     1[0m[2m. **Ghost[0m[2m charges[0m[2m (bug[0m[2m #[0m[2m2)**: The[0m[2m checkout flow does[0m[2m `check_stock`[0m[2m → `charge`[0m[2m → `decrement[0m[2m`. Between[0m[2m `[0m[2mcheck_stock` and[0m[2m `decrement`,[0m[2m multiple concurrent[0m[2m coroutines can both[0m[2m see[0m[2m stock available[0m[2m,[0m[2m both charge[0m[2m,[0m[2m but[0m[2m then only[0m[2m one successfully[0m[2m decrements. The[0m[2m other gets[0m[2m charged but returns[0m[2m `False` from[0m[2m checkout[0m[2m —[0m[2m customer[0m[2m is[0m[2m charged but receives[0m[2m no item and[0m[2m no order record[0m[2m.
     
     2. **[0m[2mOverselling ([0m[2mbug #1)**[0m[2m: The `check[0m[2m_stock` and `[0m[2mdecrement` methods[0m[2m in[0m[2m `Inventory` are[0m[2m not atomic.[0m[2m Multiple[0m[2m concurrent[0m[2m calls[0m[2m to[0m[2m `check_stock`[0m[2m can see[0m[2m stock ≥[0m[2m quantity[0m[2m,[0m[2m then all proceed[0m[2m to charge[0m[2m and[0m[2m decrement. The `[0m[2mdecrement` method[0m[2m has a race[0m[2m condition —[0m[2m between[0m[2m checking `self[0m[2m._stock >= quantity[0m[2m` and `[0m[2mself._stock -=[0m[2m quantity`, another[0m[2m coroutine can inter[0m[2mleave.
     
     The fix[0m[2m needs to:
