     - Every successful charge[0m[2m corresponds to exactly[0m[2m one item delivered[0m[2m
     - No order is[0m[2m charged more than once[0m[2m
     
     The core[0m[2m problem is the[0m[2m TOCTOU ([0m[2mtime-of-check-to[0m[2m-time-of-use[0m[2m) race between `[0m[2mcheck_stock` and[0m[2m `decrement`.[0m[2m The fix should atom[0m[2mically reserve stock[0m[2m before[0m[2m charging,[0m[2m and release[0m[2m it if[0m[2m charging[0m[2m fails.
     
